+ * keyboard navigation (the arrow keys, Enter, Space, `M`, `T` and more) and screen-reader keys,
+ * which take the editor's keys (their registration would throw) and would act on the canvas past
+ * the editing session and the clipboard plugin. They are put back with {@link restoreBlockly}.
